---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const basePath = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Report an Error & Editorial Corrections Protocol"
  description="InvestiQ VaultBanking transparent correction policy: submit factual discrepancies, statutory amendments, or mathematical errors directly to our research repository."
>
  <div class="container container-narrow corrections-page">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href={`${basePath}/`}>Home</a> &gt; 
      <span>Corrections Protocol</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="badge badge-gold">EDITORIAL INTEGRITY</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">Report an Error / Corrections Procedure</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">
        We adhere to strict standards of statutory accuracy. If you identify a discrepancy against official RBI circulars or gazettes, report it here.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="corrections-content">
      <p>
        InvestiQ VaultBanking maintains an uncompromising commitment to empirical truth and statutory fidelity. Because financial regulations, tax deductions, and central bank directives evolve, we welcome peer review and community auditing.
      </p>

      <h2>1. The Editorial Review Protocol</h2>
      <p>Every submitted correction undergoes the following verification lifecycle:</p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Factual Verification:</strong> The claim is audited against the primary Government of India Gazette, RBI Master Direction, or Supreme Court Judgment. Secondary media reports or third-party blog articles are insufficient.</li>
        <li><strong>Quantitative Audit:</strong> If a formula or calculator output is challenged, test cases are re-executed in `tests/finance-math.test.ts` to identify the boundary condition or edge case.</li>
        <li><strong>Public Correction Log:</strong> When an error is verified, the relevant article is updated immediately with an explicit editorial note and logged in our GitHub commit history.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>2. How to Submit a Correction</h2>
      <div class="card submission-card">
        <h3>Option A: Open a GitHub Issue (Fastest)</h3>
        <p>
          Submit an issue directly to our public repository with the label <code>editorial-correction</code>:
        </p>
        <a href="https://github.com/chirag127/investiq-vault-banking/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary">
          Open GitHub Issue ↗
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="card submission-card" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
        <h3>Option B: Editorial Correction Checklist</h3>
        <p>When reporting a factual or statutory error, please provide:</p>
        <ul style="margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem 1.25rem;">
          <li><strong>Page URL / Article Title:</strong> Exact page where the discrepancy appears.</li>
          <li><strong>Specific Claim:</strong> The exact sentence, threshold, or formula in question.</li>
          <li><strong>Official Source Citation:</strong> RBI Circular Number, Gazette Notification Date, or Supreme Court Case Law citation.</li>
          <li><strong>Suggested Wording:</strong> Recommended correction reflecting current legal fact.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .corrections-page {
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--iq-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--iq-text-secondary);
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--iq-border);
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--iq-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .corrections-content {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--iq-text-primary);
  }

  .corrections-content h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--iq-border-subtle);
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .submission-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--iq-surface);
  }

  .submission-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
